# Build trees, generated files and local scratch. Trimmed from the generic
# GitHub Python template: only what this repository (CMake/C++/CUDA library,
# workbench app, nanobind wheel, Python worker) actually produces. `lib/`, `*.spec`
# and `*.manifest` are deliberately NOT ignored: they would hide legitimate
# directories and files. `.vscode/` is tracked.

# --- CMake / C++ -------------------------------------------------------------
build/
compile_commands.json
CMakeUserPresets.json
imgui.ini
wisdom*
*.o
*.obj
*.gch
*.pch
*.ilk
*.pdb
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.a
*.lib
*.exe
*.out
*.app
*.dwo

# --- Local experiments (not part of the tree) --------------------------------
prototypes/
proto/
# Benchmark scratch space: generated TIFF datasets + on-the-fly cpp-tiff clone
/.bench_tmp/

